  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The safe of the proposed access is dependent on only one\r\nvehicle being parked on the frontage at any one time and on vehicles entering\r\nand exiting the site in forward gear with on site turning. The proposed\r\ndevelopment fails to provide a hardstanding of sufficient size to meet TfL\r\nstandards for on site turning and therefore does not demonstrate that a vehicle\r\ncan enter and exit the site in forward gear. The harm cannot be adequately mitigated\r\nthrough use of a planning condition or Section106 Agreement, as such measures would\r\nfail to meet the tests set out in paragraph 58 of the NPPF 2024. The development\r\nis therefore contrary to Policy T6 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies\r\nT16.1, T16.2, T16.3 and T16.4 of the Merton Local Plan (2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
